:: Wolf Sneak
<<if $agility >= 13>>
You move silently through the underbrush, avoiding the wolves' attention. Your agility serves you well -- you slip past without incident.

''Sneak successful!'' No damage taken.

[[Continue deeper|Forest River]]
[[Return to the entrance|Forest Entrance]]
<<else>>
You try to sneak past, but a branch snaps under your foot. The wolves turn toward you with glowing eyes.

''Sneak failed!'' You must fight.

[[Fight the wolves|Wolf Fight]]
[[Run back to the entrance|Forest Entrance]]
<</if>>
